name exesheet
category Package
revision 69838
shortdesc Typesetting exercise or exam sheets
relocated 1
longdesc The exesheet package is designed for typesetting exercise or
longdesc exam sheets. The primary advantage of exesheet is its ability
longdesc to display a detailed scoring guide and correction instructions
longdesc as needed. This feature is especially beneficial for grading
longdesc papers with multiple graders. The exesheet package provides:
longdesc macros for organizing exercises and subparts, specific settings
longdesc for enumeration lists, environments for questions and answers,
longdesc which can be displayed or hidden, macros for detailed comments
longdesc and grading instructions in the margins which can be displayed
longdesc or hidden. Additionally, the exesheet class loads the
longdesc schooldocs package which manages the page layout, the main
longdesc title, headers and footers.
runfiles size=9
 RELOC/tex/latex/exesheet/exesheet.cls
 RELOC/tex/latex/exesheet/exesheet.sty
catalogue-also schooldocs
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/exesheet
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics exam exercise teaching class
catalogue-version 2.7
